MODULE 3: THE DEEP LEARNING ECOSYSTEM
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION: 

- Neural networks are inspired by human brain cells. In this module, you’ll learn how neural
    networks can greatly enhance an AI system’s ability to analyze complex data and improve its
    results through trial and error.


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

- After completing this module, you should be able to:
    -> Describe how neural networks are inspired by the human brain
    -> Trace the flow of information through a perceptron’s nodes
    -> Describe machine learning’s trial-and-error learning process
    -> Define and describe deep learning and its ecosystem